1
00:00:15,804 --> 00:00:19,352
Aïe... j'ai mal à la tête.
Ouch... I have a headache.

2
00:00:20,752 --> 00:00:23,364
Tu as de la fièvre ?
Do you have a fever?

3
00:00:23,464 --> 00:00:28,644
Je ne sais pas. J'ai aussi mal à la gorge.
I don't know. I also have a sore throat.

4
00:00:29,444 --> 00:00:33,400
Allons à la pharmacie, c'est juste là.
Let's go to the pharmacy, it's right there.

5
00:00:37,353 --> 00:00:41,885
Bonjour ! Je peux vous aider ?
Hello! Can I help you?

6
00:00:43,485 --> 00:00:49,697
Bonjour, madame. J'ai mal à la tête et à la gorge.
Hello, ma'am. I have a headache and a sore throat.

7
00:00:50,497 --> 00:00:56,613
Je vois. Prenez ce médicament, deux fois par jour.
I see. Take this medicine twice a day.

8
00:00:57,413 --> 00:01:01,537
Et il faut se reposer, boire beaucoup d'eau.
And you need to rest and drink a lot of water.

9
00:01:02,537 --> 00:01:06,085
D'accord, merci beaucoup.
Okay, thank you very much.

10
00:01:07,485 --> 00:01:10,553
Je t'accompagne à la maison.
I'll take you home.

11
00:01:11,953 --> 00:01:15,285
Tu es gentil, Adrien.
You're kind, Adrien.

12
00:01:16,685 --> 00:01:20,689
Bon rétablissement, mademoiselle !
Get well soon, miss!
